    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cō^rā^lĭum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cū^rā^lĭum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏral-lum</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Sid.
